ome was up from 4 250 687 NOK in 2024. The annual result fell from 234 488 NOK in 2024 to 12 452 NOK in 2025. Equity rose from 991 247 NOK in 2024 to 1 003 699 NOK in 2025. Registered leadership: Glenn Robert Westerlund (daglig leder) and Jarle Skovly (styrets leder), with 1 other board member. Its verified website is grelektro.no, which links to its Facebook profile. Recent changes in the register: business address set to Kalvehagen 12 on 2026-09-29.","sentences":[{"text":"GR ELEKTRO AS is a private limited company registered in Vesterøy, founded 2019-01-02.","claim_ids":["c1","c3","c5","c6"]},{"text":"GR ELEKTRO AS driver med elektrisk installasjonsarbeid og kjøp og salg av varer som naturlig hører med til bransjen.","claim_ids":["c10","c9"]},{"text":"Its main industry code is 43.210: electrical installation.","claim_ids":["c4"]},{"text":"It has 1 registered workplace.","claim_ids":["c29"]},{"text":"In its 2025 accounts, total operating income was 5 730 866 NOK and the annual result was 12 452 NOK; operating income was up from 4 250 687 NOK in 2024.","claim_ids":["c52","c57","c41"]},{"text":"The annual result fell from 234 488 NOK in 2024 to 12 452 NOK in 2025.","claim_ids":["c46","c57"]},{"text":"Equity rose from 991 247 NOK in 2024 to 1 003 699 NOK in 2025.","claim_ids":["c49","c60"]},{"text":"Registered leadership: Glenn Robert Westerlund (daglig leder) and Jarle Skovly (styrets leder), with 1 other board member.","claim_ids":["c25","c26","c27"]},{"text":"Its verified website is grelektro.no, which links to its Facebook profile.","claim_ids":["c69","c71"]},{"text":"Recent changes in the register: business address set to Kalvehagen 12 on 2026-09-29.","claim_ids":["c63"]}],"unknowns":["Open positions (NAV): No active NAV job ad names this organisation number as employer (index built 2026-11-07T08:17:35+00:00).","Hiring: no open NAV job ads and no careers page on the verified website.","Dated news: none found on the verified website."],"writer":"template_v2+model_